  Color: {r: 0.6745098, g: 0.75294125, b: 1, a: 1}
  Content: "\"Felted Narratives: Stories in Wool\"\nJanet Patterson\nTextile artist
    Janet Patterson shares expressive wool creations, inviting viewers to try needle
    felting for themselves. Each piece tells a tactile story.\n\n\"The Drawing Room\"\nAva
    P Christl and Martha Jane Ritchie\nInspired by historic \u201Cwithdrawing rooms,\u201D
    this immersive display of drawings and artist books invites visitors to relax,
    engage, and create. Salon-style works and 3D pieces are accompanied by tea and
    conversation.\"\n"
  RavenSucessScript: "\u201CWool tells stories, graphite dreams aloud, and conversation
    steeps like tea. You\u2019ve strolled through a palace of tactile tales.\u201D"
  RavenHintScript: 
